# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rust / Cargo
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Generated by `cargo install`
/bin/

# Optional: workspaces typically commit Cargo.lock at the root,
# but individual library crates' lockfiles can be ignored.
# (root Cargo.lock IS committed — do not ignore it here.)

